Description: NetworkManager VPN integration for GlobalProtect via gpclient
 Integrates the upstream gpclient VPN engine with NetworkManager, including
 browser authentication and VPN connection lifecycle management. Includes
 authentication helpers and editor plugins for GTK 3 and GTK 4 applications.
 .
 Requires matching upstream gpclient and gpauth 3.x binaries and the upstream
 browser callback handler, supplied by globalprotect-openconnect. Direct
 gateway connections are the currently validated connection mode.
